 /*
  * 0198: press once per firing, release 100 ms later, then repeat with
  * volume-up after 120 s so the two consumer usages have visible controls.
+ * 0199: with prakeyevery=M the pair repeats every M s instead of stopping
+ * after two runs, and the usage alternates every run (power, volume, power,
+ * ...). Alternating matters because the usages are observed differently: a
+ * power request shows as a display-off attempt, volume-up as a HUD, so a
+ * 30 s interval gives the user two observable chances per minute at any
+ * moment they look at the screen.
